License map for this repository
=================================

This repository is not one license. It's an aggregate: this project's own
build tooling and patches, wrapped around vendored OpenSPARC T2 hypervisor
and OpenBoot PROM source (BSD+), plus machine descriptions derived from
Sun's OpenSPARC T1 configurations (GPL-2).
Read the file for the path you care about -- do not assume one license
covers everything here. The terms, and why, are in LICENSE_CODE.

    Path                                   Terms            Details
    --------------------------------------------------------------------
    src/hypervisor, src/obp                BSD+ (Sun)       LICENSE_CODE
        1389 of 1416 files have Sun's header; the other 27 do not
        (11 copyright line only, 9 nothing, 7 binary: LICENSE_SRC.MAP)
    ... of which support/stabs/ (7 files)  BSD+ and CDDL    LICENSE_CODE,
                                           headers          LICENSE_SRC.MAP
    ... of which the Forth dictionaries,   BSD+ (our         LICENSE_CODE
        src/obp (7 files)                  reading)
    md/common.hdesc, md/common.pdesc,      GPL-2 (Sun, T1)  LICENSE_CODE,
        md/*/1up.pdesc                                      md/GPLv2_License_
                                                            OpenSPARCT1.txt
    md/*/1up.hdesc                         GPL-2.0-only     LICENSE_CODE
        (built together with               (ours)
        md/common.hdesc into 1up-hv.bin)
    everything else (build/, patches/,
        scripts/, container/, tests/,      BSD-2-Clause     LICENSE_CODE,
        forth_bootstrap/, md/README,                        LICENSE.BSD-2-
        this file and the other prose                       Clause
        docs), except as listed in
        LICENSE_CODE

PRISTINE-MANIFEST records exactly what was vendored from where, with
checksums; treat it as the source of truth for provenance, this file only
for terms.
